    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112008" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοιν-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόνος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blood-red,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρήϊον αἵματι φοινόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.159
				</span></i>
			: <i>blood-red,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμὸν ἀποπϝείων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ap.</u>
					362
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>deadly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκη, ὄλεθρος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				146
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				675
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Al.</u>
					187
				</span></i>
			.</div>
